a Coverage\nFeature Stories\nMedia Contact\nAlumni & Friends\nAlumni Stories\nReunions & Homecomings\nGiving\nWays to Give\nH.K.U.E.A.A.\nContact Update Form\nPhD/MPhil\nAdmissions PhD/MPhil\nResearch\nPostgraduate\nPhD/MPhil Admissions\nApplication Procedures\nAdmission Requirements\nProgramme Structure\nScholarships, Financial Assistance and Fees\nPostgraduate Admissions Advisors\nFAQ\nContent\nResearch Postgraduate Studies Overview\nWhy study Engineering at the University of Hong Kong?\nThe Faculty of Engineering is not only a place that nurtures technology inventors and scientific pioneers. We educate and shape leaders. We prepare global leaders to drive tomorrow\u2019s technologies, to build our society and to advance our world.\nWorld-class Faculty and Departments\nThe Faculty has consistently ranked high among universities around the world. In QS ranking 2025, the subject rankings of the Faculty were:\nCivil &\nStructural\nEngineering13th\nComputer Science &\nInformation Systems21st\nElectrical and\nComputer\nEngineering38th\nData Science &\nArtificial Intelligence18th\nMechanical\nEngineering49th\nWorld-class Scholars\nOur faculty members are among the world\u2019s leading scholars in Engineering:\n7 Highly Cited Researchers by Clarivate, formerly Clarivate Analytics and the Intellectual Property and Science business of Thomson Reuters (2024)\n42 Faculty members ranked in the top 1% worldwide by citations according to the Clarivate Analytics\u2019 Essential Science Indicators (2025)\nWorking with our team of world-class scholars and researchers, our RPg students are ready to develop vision and knowledge to be global leaders and to advance the world.\nInterdisciplinary Engagement\nWe provide a well-rounded curriculum and high quality engineering education for the global knowledge-based economy, and engage in innovative, high impact basic and applied research within and across disciplines. The Faculty has devoted a vast amount of resources to teaching and research and presently offers research postgraduate (MPhil and PhD) programmes in different engineering and technology areas.\nInternationalization and Diversity\nThe Faculty has a century legacy of achievement in advancing scientific discovery, transferring the city\u2019s technological development and educating regional and international leaders. We have attracted over 1,000 applications for admission each year recently. At present, more than 800 research students from over 10 countries, including Canada, China, India, Italy, Malaysia, Sri Lanka, UK and US, are in different stages of studies in the Faculty allowing students to embrace cultural diversity through mixing with their fellow classmates from all over the world.\nCopyright \u00a9 2026 by Faculty of Engineering, The University of Hong Kong\nContact Us |\nLinkedIn |\nFacebook |\nInstagram |\nYouTube |\nPrivacy Policy | Web Accessibility", "links": [["", "https://engg.hku.hk/"], ["Wellness@HKU", "https://wellness.hku.hk"], ["Student Support Centre", "https://engg.hku.hk/Students-Support-Centre"], ["HKU Home", "https://hku.hk/"], ["HKU Portal", "http://hkuportal.hku.hk"], ["", "https://engg.hku.hk/Admissions/PhD-MPhil"], ["Search", "javascript:__doPostBack('dnn$dnnSEARCH$cmdSearch','')"], ["About Us", "https://engg.hku.hk/About-Us"], ["Message from the Dean", "https://engg.hku.hk/About-Us/Message-from-the-Dean"], ["Vision and Mission", "https://engg.hku.hk/About-Us/Vision-and-Mission"], ["History", "https://engg.hku.hk/About-Us/History"], ["List of Deans (1912-)", "https://engg.hku.hk/About-Us/History/List-of-Deans"], ["Dean's Office", "https://engg.hku.hk/About-Us/Deans-Office"], ["Academic Staff", "https://engg.hku.hk/About-Us/Academic-Staff"], ["Departments/Schools", "https://engg.hku.hk/About-Us/Departments"], ["Career Opportunities", "https://jobs.hku.hk/en/filter/?brand=faculty%20of%20engineering"], ["Contact Us", "https://engg.hku.hk/About-Us/Contact-Us"], ["Admissions", "https://engg.hku.hk/Admissions"], 